# Extra themes — one line per theme. The list is user-overridable at
# ~/.config/hexciri/theme-sources/extra.list (seeded from this shipped copy).
# A bare owner/repo is the literal repo path (everything after github.com/);
# short convention names fall back to omarchy-<name>-theme, so both work:
#   <owner>/<repo>                       literal, e.g. signaldirective/neo-eldritch
#   <owner>/<name>                       -> falls back to github.com/<owner>/omarchy-<name>-theme
#   <owner>/omarchy-<name>-theme         the literal convention repo path
#   https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>    full URL (any repo, any naming convention)
#
# Removing a line removes that theme on the next sync.
HANCORE-linux/omarchy-aamis-theme
HANCORE-linux/omarchy-sapphire-theme
OldJobobo/omarchy-everpuccin-theme